    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do Not Fall is a fast-paced, parkour-style platformer where you must jump, climb, and maneuver through surreal landscapes to find your way back home. You wake up on a massive mountain with no explanation\u2014just the endless sky above and the only way forward... <i>down</i>. As you descend, you\u2019ll encounter mysterious floating platforms, shifting gravity, and strange portals leading to bizarre new realms. Will you make it back to reality, or is this endless journey your new fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour &amp; Precision Jumping</strong> \u2013 Master fluid movement as you climb, leap, and balance across challenging environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal, Ever-Changing Worlds</strong> \u2013 Travel through dreamlike landscapes, from floating islands to gravity-defying structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery &amp; Discovery</strong> \u2013 Unravel the cryptic messages left behind by those who came before you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No checkpoints, no second chances\u2014every move matters. Fall too far, and you\u2019ll have to climb back up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Experience a journey of persistence, mystery, and determination without lengthy cutscenes or dialogue.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do Not Fall is a fast-paced, parkour-style platformer where you must jump, climb, and maneuver through surreal landscapes to find your way back home. You wake up on a massive mountain with no explanation\u2014just the endless sky above and the only way forward... <i>down</i>. As you descend, you\u2019ll encounter mysterious floating platforms, shifting gravity, and strange portals leading to bizarre new realms. Will you make it back to reality, or is this endless journey your new fate?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour &amp; Precision Jumping</strong> \u2013 Master fluid movement as you climb, leap, and balance across challenging environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal, Ever-Changing Worlds</strong> \u2013 Travel through dreamlike landscapes, from floating islands to gravity-defying structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery &amp; Discovery</strong> \u2013 Unravel the cryptic messages left behind by those who came before you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No checkpoints, no second chances\u2014every move matters. Fall too far, and you\u2019ll have to climb back up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Experience a journey of persistence, mystery, and determination without lengthy cutscenes or dialogue.</p></li></ul>",
